  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>After 8th level, a phantom thief can no longer be flanked. This defense denies a rogue the ability to sneak attack the phantom thief by flanking him, unless the attacker has at least four more rogue levels than the target has phantom thief levels.</p>\n<p>If a character already has uncanny dodge (see above) from another class, the levels from the classes that grant uncanny dodge stack to determine the minimum rogue level required to flank the character.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/phantom-thief#toc9\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
